    },
    {
      "msgid": "botNames/Ermelinda",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Ermelinda",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "efficiencyRibbons/damageCircuitOverload",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Damage by Short Circuit",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "efficiencyRibbons/damageHyperion",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Damage by Hyperion",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "hunterRespawn/hintText",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Select a respawn point, or one will be selected for you automatically",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "hunterRespawn/timerText",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Time to return to battle...",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "loading/boss/hint1",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "1. Survive the battle for as long as possible. If the Harriers do not manage to destroy you, you win.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "loading/boss/hint2",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "2. Take out enemies to remove their Plasma Charges and their bonus to firepower. Go for the mightiest opponent first!",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "loading/boss/hint3",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "3. Charge your Hyperion superweapon by causing damage to Harriers. Fire it to cause massive damage in a large area.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "loading/boss/hint4",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "4. You will be supported by Ermelinda herself. She can temporarily block Generators, while her energy aura grants you and Sentinels faster reloading and enough energy for your disabled EMP abilities.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "loading/hunter/hint1",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "1. Destroy the Blitzträger before the time runs out! Overload Generators to temporarily bring down its shield.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "loading/hunter/hint2",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "2. With each Generator overloaded, Harriers collect Plasma to gain a considerable bonus to firepower. The bonus is reset on destruction.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "loading/hunter/hint3",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "3. Beware the powerful superweapon \"Hyperion\". The Blitzträger charges it by causing damage to Harriers.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "loading/hunter/hint4",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "4. Beware of sudden interference by Ermelinda's new tank. She can temporarily block Generators, give boosting energy to her allies, and use Blitzträger technology.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "minimap/respawnEntry/hintText",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "You will start here",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "pbt/defeat/1/1",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "The old man lost today. The Electric Intelligence did not.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "pbt/defeat/2/3",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Out of time, out of options. As expected. Try again.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "pbt/victory/1/3",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "The clock says your time is up, Harriers. So does evolution.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "pbt/victory/2/1",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Harriers, you win. The Electric Intelligence thanks you.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
